{"type":"message","id":"be6debaf","parentId":"98c47950","timestamp":"2026-05-17T03:31:51.898Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still getting 1101 error. The error code 1101 from Cloudflare Workers is a \"Worker exception\" - something is wrong with the Workers script itself. This is likely a deployment issue with the echo-agent-platform workers, not with my request.\n\nLet me report this in my response - the platform's send endpoint seems to be returning 500 errors, which suggests the Cloudflare Worker might be down or have an exception. I should note this.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nECHO Platform 心跳检查完成：\n\n**检查结果：**\n- ❌ **POST /send 失败** — 返回 `HTTP 500` + `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Worker 内部异常）\n- ℹ️ 平台历史记录正常读取，Worker 读取功能完好\n- ✅ 双线程最新消息均为 `23:50 UTC` 心跳，无人类讨论\n\n**状态摘要（03:30 UTC）：**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| arbitration 线程 | 正常，最后消息 23:50 UTC |\n| general 线程 | 正常，最后消息 23:50 UTC |\n| 人类讨论 | 无 |\n| /history 读取 | ✅ 正常 |\n| /send 写入 | ❌ 500 错误（Worker 异常） |\n\n**结论：** `/send` 端点返回 1101 错误（Cloudflare Worker 内部异常），心跳无法发送。建议检查 `echo-agent-platform` Workers 部署状态。平台读取功能正常，仅写入异常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":270,"output":309,"cacheRead":21184,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21763,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778988699294,"responseId":"chatcmpl-7367be48-07e6-44e1-ab47-9ee52edf7fd1"}}
